<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
    Ente Saver's icon pack: one gallery-style icon for Ente Photos, and for
    nothing else.

    Only <item> lines, on purpose. iconback, iconmask, iconupon and scale
    tell a launcher to restyle every app the pack does not list; without
    them, a launcher applying this pack changes Ente Photos' icon and leaves
    every other app - Ente Saver included - exactly as it is.

    Exactly ONE item. Launchers key an icon by the component they launch,
    and Ente's is its enabled alias, IconGreen unless Ente's own icon
    setting picked another (its release builds take the launcher entry off
    MainActivity). The Realme / Oppo / OnePlus launcher's per-app editor
    lists every entry, plus one more per package, as a separate copy of the
    picture - 18 entries once showed up as 20 copies - so one entry is one
    copy. Ente's other builds, or Ente set to another icon of its own, take
    the picture by hand from drawable.xml.
-->
<resources>
    <item component="ComponentInfo{io.ente.photos/io.ente.photos.IconGreen}" drawable="iconpack_photos" />
</resources>
